          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": 0.8
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1.5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "How much this symbol moves relative to the rest of the tracked universe.\n\n- **Beta** — 1.0 moves with the basket, above 1.0 amplifies it, below 1.0 damps it.\n\nMeasured against an equal-weighted basket of the tracked symbols, because no index series is stored. Comparable between these symbols, but not with a published NIFTY beta."
    },
